-on-year increase in more than four years, adding to inflation pressure after the hot CPI print.", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNOXBPbnpTYVoxLUJfaDFHQjdrTFJXblFfN0FRVENPaEcxd0FfZWZJYk5kQ2tmUzRiYWhaSXdlUG9tVjgzVmRXZGlBaW1MQlZtRkFkQ0dxWkktQTNPdHM2anpjNGVMVnlWYUVuODlfVlZPbHp0T0pDcTNONU1RTDUyZDlIbkZUbnJNcjctWkdZQzZGeUpQOGkzcHY2R0RqRGM1?oc=5", "source": "Reuters", "scale": "notable", "category": "macro-data", "region": "US", "c": -0.187, "via": "rates"}, {"id": "6b4e4c13e764", "ts": "2026-10-15T12:30:00Z", "title": "US September PPI jumps 6.3% y/y, biggest annual gain since 2022", "summary": "US producer prices rose 1.3% m/m and 6.3% y/y in September (from 5.6% in August), versus about 0.6% and 5.5% expected; energy from the Middle East conflict drove the jump. Core PPI ex food, energy and trade rose 0.5% m/m and 5% y/y.", "url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/15/september-producer-price-index-retail-sales-data.html", "source": "CNBC", "scale": "notable", "category": "macro-data", "region": "US", "c": -0.142, "via": "rates"}, {"id": "f922f8562299", "ts": "2026-10-14T12:30:00Z", "title": "US September CPI comes in hot at about 3.7%; October Fed hike odds jump to about 47%", "summary": "Energy-driven inflation lifted rate-hike bets from about 20%. S&P 500 fell 0.6%, chipmakers led losses; 10-year yield near 5.33%.", "url": "https://sundayguardianlive.com/business/s-p-500-today-live-index-falls-060-as-hot-us-cpi-inflation-fuels-fed-rate-hike-bets-treasury-yields-rise-oil-nears-106-check-top-gainers-losers-and-what-investors-should-watch-305738/", "source": "Reuters via Sunday Guardian", "scale": "major", "category": "macro-data", "region": "United States", "c": -0.124, "via": "rates"}, {"id": "bd4998ac79c7", "ts": "2026-10-15T01:00:00Z", "title": "Dollar retreats from 18-month high as Fed's Bowman and Daly temper hike bets", "summary": "The dollar index slipped to about 102.06 after the hot CPI pushed it to an 18-month high; Bowman and Daly said the Fed can wait for a clearer picture before the Oct 27-28 meeting, and the 10-year yield fell to a three-week low near 5.13%.", "url": "https://www.tradingview.com/news/reuters.com,2026:newsml_L4N46104B:0-dollar-retreats-from-18-month-high-despite-hot-cpi-as-fed-officials-temper-hike-bets/", "source": "Reuters via TradingView", "scale": "notable", "category": "central-bank", "region": "US", "c": 0.123, "via": "rates"}, {"id": "b9047cd1f152", "ts": "2026-10-19T16:30:35Z", "title": "Scotiabank and BMO now expect a 25 bp Bank of Canada hike next week", "summary": "After September CPI rose to 3.1%, Scotiabank and BMO both said they expect the Bank of Canada to raise rates by 25 bp at next week's decision; BoC surveys also showed higher inflation expectations.", "url": "https://www.financialjuice.com/News/9811687/BMO-sees-Bank-of-Canada-hike-25-BPS-next-week.aspx?xy=rss", "source": "FinancialJuice", "scale": "minor", "category": "other", "region": "Canada", "c": -0.118, "via": "rates"}, {"id": "cea346a0c667", "ts": "2026-10-18T11:20:00Z", "title": "Ukraine launches more than 1,000 drones at Russia, setting St Petersburg oil terminal and depot ablaze", "summary": "Russia's defence ministry said it downed about 1,015 Ukrainian drones overnight, one of the largest attacks of the war; fires hit the St Petersburg oil terminal, the Ruchyi oil depot and a VK data centre, with one person killed. Russia answered with about 300 drones.", "url": "https://abcnews.com/International/ukraine-targets-russia-1000-drones-striking-oil-terminal/story?id=137358203", "source": "ABC News", "scale": "notable", "category": "conflict", "region": "Russia", "c": -0.112, "via": "oil"}, {"id": "8456e147321e", "ts": "2026-10-17T12:41:00Z", "title": "IRGC says a second supertanker hit a naval mine in Hormuz and declares the strait closed", "summary": "Iran's IRGC said a second supertanker struck a naval mine on an unauthorized Strait of Hormuz route and declared the strait closed after the tanker h